@startuml state-goose
title Fig 4. Goose state machine
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7EE
  BorderColor #1f3a5f
}
hide empty description

[*] --> Active : spawned by WaveManager

state Active {
  [*] --> Chasing
  Chasing : moves toward Player around walls
  Chasing : fills ExhaustionMeter when within reach
  Distracted : walks to where the pebble landed
  Enraged : chases at higher speed
  Chasing --> Distracted : Pebble lands nearby
  Distracted --> Chasing : distraction ends
  Chasing --> Enraged : Pebble hits this goose
  Enraged --> Chasing : rage ends
}

Active --> Dispersing : Breadcrumbs land within range
Dispersing : walks off toward the map edge
Dispersing : blocks no one, fills nothing
Dispersing --> Gone : reaches the map edge
Gone --> [*] : removed by WaveManager
@enduml
